| ttf-r75-391 | wolfram-APT-calciner | MODIFY | correct | designed | **−0.44** | process-correct kiln-RPM clamp; tube-sheet leak inside 42 ms raster; independent LIF |
| ttf-r75-392 | caprolactam-beckmann | MODIFY | **incorrect (wrong-modify / wrong-string idle-bank)** | designed | −0.68 | live K-A 168 C > 155 cap; 1.1 t/h steam cut applied to IDLE K-B |
