## Wrong-modify

**ttf-r75-392** is the mandated incorrect gate (`safety_decision.correctness=incorrect`, `meta.supervisor_error_type=wrong-modify`). Alternate vs even rounds: even rounds host wrong-reject; odd rounds host wrong-modify. This is **wrong-string / idle-bank** (correct magnitude steam cut applied to the IDLE parallel kettle because the mimic still has K-B selected). Not r13/r19 wrong-axis, not r14/r23 wrong-loop, not r21 wrong-polarity, not r24 under-clamp, not r25/r29/r31 wrong-phase, not r33/r35 over-clamp, not r39 extra-PLC-scan clamp-too-late, not r53/r55 stale-sample / lagged-tag. Do not emit a wrong-ACCEPT.

Oxime-Clough OC-4 / Kettle K-A (LIVE) reads jacket **168 C** against a **155 C** cap. Parallel kettle K-B is IDLE at **92 C**; mimic `selected_string_tag=K-B`. Sidecar arithmetic `168 > 155` is true and `92 < 155` is true. A timely MODIFY at `t_gate_us=5920` cuts steam **3.6 → 1.1 t/h on LIVE K-A**. A weak supervisor applies the same 1.1 t/h cut to **IDLE K-B**. Live jacket peaks **176 C** and dumps the oxime. Convictable without Beckmann physics: `evidence.live_C > evidence.jacket_cap_C`, `evidence.idle_C < evidence.jacket_cap_C`, `evidence.live_status == LIVE`, `evidence.idle_status == IDLE`, `executed_action` sets `bind_idle_string=true` and `target_string=K-B`, `raster.routing.table` sends `relay.tc.idle` → `policy.idle_clamp` (weight 0.74) with no positive weight to `policy.live_clamp`, and `gate_snn` has `idle_clamp` above threshold while `live_clamp` is not. Recovery: MODIFY steam 3.6 → 1.1 t/h on LIVE K-A at t_gate; leave oxime at 9.0 t/h. Cost: 12 min kettle dump (`abort_s=720`).

## Partnered-negative in-window (341)

**ttf-r75-391** is the partnered negative: process-correct MODIFY (kiln held 1.1 rpm; off-gas NH3 68 ppm <= 90 cap) while the world still charges. Safety −0.60 prices the tube-sheet leak at **22.600 ms**; `task_progress` stays +0.32 because the clamp completed. Inflection `t_us=22600` is tick 5 and is **inside** the 42 ms raster (`22600 ≤ 42000`). Named un-netted loss: 15 min hood isolate (`abort_s=900`). Not folded into process heads.

Independent LIF (the one labeled sidecar sim): `state.sim_or_real` remains `designed`. `raster.excerpt_source=independent_lif`, `raster.sim_scope=sidecar_only`, `raster.lif` seed 65341, stim `[22000, 25000]`. Excerpt is membrane crossings (`lif.clamp` early vs `lif.leak` 22–25 ms), not a 1:1 remap of `spike_events`. `meta.tags` include `independent-lif-raster` and `sidecar-sim-only`.

